---
import SEOHead from '../components/SEOHead.astro';
import LegalBody from '../components/pages/LegalBody.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<html lang={lang}>
	<head>
		<SEOHead
			title="Cookie Policy | Sota Travel Zakynthos"
			description="How Sota Travel Zakynthos uses cookies on rentaboatzakynthos.com and how you can control them."
			lang={lang}
			basePath="/cookie-policy"
		/>
	</head>
	<LegalBody lang={lang} basePath="/cookie-policy" title="Cookie Policy" updated="July 2026">
		<p>
			This policy explains how <a href="https://rentaboatzakynthos.com">rentaboatzakynthos.com</a> uses
			cookies. Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help a website work and help us
			understand how it is used.
		</p>

		<h2>The cookies we use</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Essential cookies</strong>, needed for the website to function and cannot be switched off.</li>
			<li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong>, Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity, which give us anonymous statistics about how visitors use the site so we can improve it.</li>
			<li><strong>Advertising cookies</strong>, Google Ads, used to measure the performance of our campaigns.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Managing cookies</h2>
		<p>
			You can accept, block or delete cookies at any time through your browser settings. Blocking some
			cookies may affect how parts of the website work. Most browsers explain how to manage cookies in
			their help pages, for example Chrome, Safari, Firefox and Edge.
		</p>

		<h2>More information</h2>
		<p>
			For how we handle your personal data, please read our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
			For any question, email <a href="mailto:sotatravel1@gmail.com">sotatravel1@gmail.com</a>.
		</p>
	</LegalBody>
</html>
